External resources
------------------

Drug Repurposing Hub, ChEMBL and PubChem are referenced by the manuscript as auxiliary
public resources. They are read at their source and are not redistributed here. Their
licences and access conditions are recorded in dataset_urls.txt.

Clinical material
-----------------

The primary cohort, the archived assay material and the human reader assessments are
clinical and human data that this distribution does not contain and does not describe at
record level. No personally identifiable information was processed at any point.
